        "answer": {
          "short": "True",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-4+2\\times3&=-4+6\\\\&=2\\\\-4+(2\\times3)&=-4+6\\\\&=2\\end{align*}$$\nTrue. Multiplication is performed first on both sides.",
